              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "* The concert set list and sequence of songs are subject to change prior to live performance."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-2eed0b5a5813290f"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Venue: Pillow Theater, 142 Glaux Avenue, Golden Hour, Penacony"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-025a58ea0e135021"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Prohibited Items:"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "1. Controlled items such as thermal, kinetic, quantum energy weapons and other sharp-edged controlled tools. Inorganic beings and those with modified prosthetic body parts are required to remove any weaponized components in advance."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-7a1947c33c61e0ec"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "2. Flammable and explosive items such as fireworks, alcohol, lighters, quantum bombs, and portable nuclear weapons. If you are an inorganic being, please kindly refrain from bringing motor oil with you to the theater."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-f18e324092d4132e"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "3. Food and beverages with strong odors such as Baviru cheese, swamp garlic, one-eyed herring, mung bean soda, and trash-flavored SoulGlad."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-98db4cb959e11877"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "4. Sound amplification equipment such as musical instruments, echoers, automated orchestras, and transaural birds."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-d1e1decb14872da2"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "5. Dangerous substances such as hazardous agents, infectious pathogens, and viruses targeting inorganic beings."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-0319c80aabb45321"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "6. Unauthorized professional filming equipment, including but not limited to cameras, camcorders, dream bubble recorders, and other memory storage devices."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-8946b3a8924959a8"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "7. Flying devices such as drones, flying saucers, jetpacks, and space motorcycles. If you have wings, please kindly refrain from flying within the theater."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-97b899545b8e80d3"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "8. Negative emotions such as sadness, pain, anger, jealousy, etc."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-c1285081d0a36c53"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "9. Other items explicitly prohibited in the Dreamscape or other items that the Bloodhound Family deems incompatible with the concert or having an obvious safety risk."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-0bd9e1f5ac3bab74"
          }
        ]
      }
